{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act40side_level_act40side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act40side",
  "stageId": "act40side_07",
  "title": "五省盘",
  "storyCode": "OR-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f94e2b6043763efe74e340b041e696a8dd201399e70b375acdb3ecc85713ab48",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杂乱的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "救火！快救火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杂乱的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有刺客！保护陛下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杂乱的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "卫兵，卫兵——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻的守军",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1637_1",
      "text": "清理火源，封锁现场！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1612_1",
      "text": "当心——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1612_1",
      "text": "这个火的来处......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1612_1",
      "text": "所有人！别碰杯子里的酒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1612_1",
      "text": "（是低温火焰......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1612_1",
      "text": "（是何人......他想做什么？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "麟青砚试图让慌乱的人群冷静下来，可她的声音很快就被嘈杂的呼喊声淹没。\n在一片混乱中，她看到了一个熟悉的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "只有一个眼神的交会，但麟青砚很清楚。\n那人看到了自己，看到了自己方才试图当众做出的出格举动。\n但她的目标并不是自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1612_1",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1612_1",
      "text": "煌......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫不服",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1619_1",
      "text": "吵什么？怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "资深厨师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1636_1",
      "text": "不好了！听说百珍宴的会场，不知道怎么回事，突然起了一阵妖火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "资深厨师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1636_1",
      "text": "卫兵已经把会场全部围起来了，不知道现在里面什么情况，也不知道陛下有没有受伤......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "资深厨师",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1636_1",
      "text": "他们说要......中断百珍宴......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫不服",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1619_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "麟青砚......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卫兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1637_1",
      "text": "我们收到消息，百珍宴混入了来历不明的人，现在进行检查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卫兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1637_1",
      "text": "请所有人待在原地不要动，配合我们检查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "（该死......惊蛰那边到底出什么事了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "（不行，不能把她丢在那......得去看看......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卫兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1637_1",
      "text": "那边的！不要走动！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "（怎么办怎么办，总不能在这里打起来......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "（来不及了......！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卫兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1637_1",
      "text": "那个人！追！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "百夫长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1637_1",
      "text": "一营、五营，封锁南门入口；七营、九营，关闭北门！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "百夫长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1637_1",
      "text": "剩下的人，由南向北细致排查。一旦查到身份可疑的人，直接逮捕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "百夫长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1637_1",
      "text": "情报说，破坏百珍宴的犯人至少为两人一组共同作案，都小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "真要命，这么多守军......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "惊蛰啊惊蛰......你到底捅了多大的娄子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "不过听上去倒还没有被抓起来......你到底在哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "啧......这宫殿怎么这么大啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "怎么是你？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "嘘——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "你们不是要去找陛下申请翻案吗？怎么会搞成这样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我也不知道啊，那把火可不是我们放的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "可是偏偏在这个时候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "你还是赶紧离开吧！要是被发现，就是有一百张嘴也说不清楚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我还要把麟青砚那个家伙救出来呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "......让我去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "这么危险的事！怎么能交给你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "禁城，我总比你熟悉一点，就算万一被抓到了，也总有解释的余地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "放心吧，我会找到麟少卿的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "你还是信不过我，是还在生我的气吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "当然不——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "现在就往南门跑，赶在卫兵封锁出口之前！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "......跑出去以后，我们还在那家饭馆碰头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "你也要小心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "等一下，刚才有卫兵看到你的样子了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "呃......应该是被看到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "这可不好办了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "唉......对了！把你的衣服脱下来，换给我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻的卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "我好像看到前面有人跑过去了！那边！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "现场已经被清空了......麟少卿应该不在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "可是到底会是谁在百珍宴上做这种事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "希望煌已经顺利跑出去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1634_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1634_1",
      "text": "......怎么会是她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1634_1",
      "text": "这两个孩子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1634_1",
      "text": "......难道真有命数？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "似乎是不远了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "不知道她们那边情况怎么样了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "......找到你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "谁？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "原来就是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "嘶......好厉害的剑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "你这身打扮，看起来和一般士兵不太一样啊。难道你是什么将军？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "休要多言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "你就是麟青砚一直努力想要藏起来的人......可是她为什么又要带你来禁城？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "呃......我知道擅闯别人的国宴确实是件不礼貌的事，可你愿不愿意相信，我们真的没有恶意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我要是说，这是个误会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "不会有什么误会，禁军追查你的下落，已经有四十年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "你是她的后人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "你在说什么？谁的后人？“她”是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你当真不知——\n不，看上去，你没有说谎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "你被保护起来这么久，莫非从来没有人和你说过你的身世？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "哈哈，还真让你说对了......我也很好奇我的身世，到底有没有人能告诉我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "可是，禁军？找我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "四十年前，谋逆罪臣家中唯一一个下落不明的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "你......说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "煌，我再确认一遍......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "你是1062年，在维多利亚出生的，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "对啊，从我记事起，我就是在维多利亚长大的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1612_1",
      "text": "你父亲生前，似乎花了很多年在追查一个真相......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "text": "万一......你发现，你周围的一切，都是一个巨大的谎言......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "什......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "这都是什么和什么！*炎国粗口*闭嘴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "你的身份特殊，如何处置须听候审决。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "跟我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "休想！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "（呃——！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "你的实力不弱，我没有把握在不伤你的前提下将你拿住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "不想受伤的话，乖乖束手就擒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "开什么玩笑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1612_1",
      "text": "（沉重的喘息）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1612_1",
      "text": "我不是说过......出了事你先跑吗......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "......麟青砚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "麟青砚看到了煌的眼神。\n她明白，她却只能沉默。\n她转过身，挡在了煌的身前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1612_1",
      "text": "麟少卿，我敬重你在大理寺的名望，之前才好意提醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1612_1",
      "text": "看来你终究是一点都没有把我的警告放在心上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1612_1",
      "text": "我很清楚自己在做什么，不用你提醒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "你已经察觉到了她的身份，却还要庇护这个罪臣的后人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "......为何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1612_1",
      "text": "为了真相......你们所有人都避而不谈的真相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "麟青砚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "你们在说什么......什么叫......我是罪臣的后代？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我爸他......到底是什么人，他又是为什么死的......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1612_1",
      "text": "抱歉......本来打算今晚过后，就全部告诉你的。现在看起来实在不是个好时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1612_1",
      "text": "只要今天能活着离开这，之后你让我怎么道歉都行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "她今天必须跟我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1612_1",
      "text": "......有我在，你休想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "且不论赢过我，想要拦我，像你这样的实力，得要三个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "麟青砚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1612_1",
      "text": "......走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "惊雷在宫墙上炸开一个缺口，紧接着，又一道稍柔和的能量击中了煌。\n她的身体飞出了这座禁城，向遥远的地面坠去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "煌曾无数次从高处跃下，跳入战场中央，或是任何需要她的地方。\n她从不曾畏惧，她相信自己的力量，相信她的许多同伴。\n她也绝不迷茫，她很清楚自己是谁，也很清楚自己坚守的方向和信仰。\n没有什么阴谋伎俩能抵挡她的热量，就像晨雾无法遮蔽太阳。\n......可现在呢？\n等待她的不再是一个坚实的地面，而是无尽的深渊。\n她闭上了眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "宁茵气若游丝地躺在床上。\n老人拄着拐杖的手颤抖着，他几欲摔倒。\n他已经活得够久，见得够多，他原本以为这世上已经不再有什么能让他失态的事。\n老人的嘴唇翕动着，但不论怎样，他都没能发出声音。\n直到阴影中的人先开了口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "她还活着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "是你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1634_1",
      "text": "宁大人留步，不可再上前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1634_1",
      "text": "今晚你没有见过我，她也没有离开过家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "她......这是怎么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1634_1",
      "text": "她擅自闯入百珍宴，我发现她的时候，她正和那个孩子在一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1634_1",
      "text": "如果今天她遇上的是其他任何一个人，她断然活不下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "竟然......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "四十年了......竟然还是你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "四十年前，你把她留了下来，如今，又救她一命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "命......大抵是命吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "......逃不过，到底逃不过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1634_1",
      "text": "我留下她并非为了救她，救下她的，是宁大人才对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1634_1",
      "text": "宁大人曾立誓永远不让这桩旧案再被人知晓，才换来这个孩子的姓名。如今看来，宁大人有食言之嫌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1634_1",
      "text": "今晚变故，真龙总会知晓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1634_1",
      "text": "选择在宁大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一阵风起，仿佛什么都没有发生过。\n老人有些恍惚。\n可他听到院墙外又传来了一阵喧闹。\n似是怒吼，似是哭诉，似是斥责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "真是昏了头......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "这都秋天了......哪来的蝉鸣啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "这是......我怎么在这？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "哟，醒啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "我就说你身板结实肯定没事，看，这不还活蹦乱跳的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "老姜还大惊小怪，非嚷嚷着要给你找大夫，也不看看都几点了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我晕过去多久了......她们在哪？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "麟青砚......宁茵她来过了吗？我......怎么会在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "别急别急，你一口气问这么多，我也不知道从哪开始回答啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "晚上的时候我本来想去晚市拣点便宜菜的，结果看见你就大咧咧地躺在路中央，我还以为你喝醉了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "我怕你冻感冒，就顺手把你捡回来咯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "你睡得迷迷糊糊的，还骂人呢。骂这个伪君子，骂那个大骗子，还有好多......啧啧，都不知道你上哪学的这些炎国话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "你说的宁茵，还有叫麟青砚什么的......没见过，不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我要去找她们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "欸欸，你上哪去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "......禁城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "我刚刚可看见外面都是巡逻卫兵，你觉得自己还进得去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我不管，那我也得去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "......把自己都弄丢了，你还想找谁啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "你......你说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "我没说错啊，可不是把自己弄丢了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "不知道自己打哪儿来，想不通自己要上哪去，所以听了别人三言两语，连自己姓啥叫啥都搞不清，更不知道自己是谁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "谬矣，谬矣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "一粒橘子的种子，被风从江南吹到了江北，落地生根，开花结果。让种子变成桔子的，不是江南也不是江北，是这几十年的阳光雨露。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "还是同样一枚果子，江南江北的写法虽不同，可果子还是这枚果子，不会有什么变化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "物有本末，事分名实......想通了这一茬，才能再问别的一二三四啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "你......知道什么？你是不是知道什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我知道什么？我就是一个做饭的厨子，知道的不过是油盐酱醋、烹炒煎炸——\n哦对，看见你我倒是想起来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "你不是一直要找那种味道正宗的桔红酥吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "我好像，知道怎么做了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "aliases": [
        "煌"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
